   "text": "Americans for Immigrant Justice, we’ve been here for 30 years. We want to be here in perpetuity. The next 30 years for Americans for Immigrant Justice, we want to be with the city of Miami, the state of Florida. We want to be with the United States and continuing to move forward with democratic principles, with the fight for human rights, for being that leader and that shining star of hope, of future, of being able to provide for the next generation.",
