   "text": "We have to believe in the rule of law, due process, dignity, that we want to really stand by fellow humans, whether we’re here at Americans for Immigrant Justice, whether we’re community members that support the work of Americans for Immigrant Justice. I hope that many of us will join in this type of fight in terms of standing up for what’s right and standing up for our human neighbors.",
